# Example domain list: /opt/dns-to-bgp/domains.d/NAME.list
# Any number of *.list files may live in the directory; they are merged.
# One pattern per line. "*.domain" matches subdomains only (never the apex).
# "domain" without "*." matches the apex only, never subdomains. "#" starts a comment.
*.cdn.example.net
*.media.example.org
*.video.example.com
